      "source": "A variation on <a href=\"ServerHttpAsyncRequestControl.html#start()\"><code>ServerHttpAsyncRequestControl.start()</code></a> that allows specifying a timeout value to use\nfor asynchronous processing. If <a href=\"ServerHttpAsyncRequestControl.html#complete()\"><code>ServerHttpAsyncRequestControl.complete()</code></a> is not called within the\nspecified value, the request times out.",
