      "source": "Enable asynchronous processing after which the response remains open until a call\nto <a href=\"ServerHttpAsyncRequestControl.html#complete()\"><code>ServerHttpAsyncRequestControl.complete()</code></a> is made or the server times out the request.",
      "translation": "启用异步处理，在此模式下响应将保持打开状态，直到调用<a href=\"ServerHttpAsyncRequestControl.html#complete()\"><code>ServerHttpAsyncRequestControl.complete()</code></a>或服务器超时。",
      "count": 2
