    {
      "source": "Enable asynchronous processing after which the response remains open until a call\nto <a href=\"ServerHttpAsyncRequestControl.html#complete()\"><code>ServerHttpAsyncRequestControl.complete()</code></a> is made or the server times out the request. Once enabled,\nadditional calls to this method are ignored.",
      "translation": "启用异步处理，在此模式下响应将保持打开状态，直到调用 <a href=\"ServerHttpAsyncRequestControl.html#complete()\"><code>ServerHttpAsyncRequestControl.complete()</code></a> 或服务器超时。一旦启用，对此方法的额外调用将被忽略。",
      "count": 2
